        "text": "Reference class and base rate: for the same SA total nonfarm JOLTS level series, the 2024-01 through 2026-05 monthly path moved from 8.378 million to 7.594 million, with large month-to-month noise and no stable acceleration. A persistence/random-walk base rate from the latest official JOLTS print starts at 7.594 million."
