        "text": "Current-release adjustment: May 2026 was flat at 1.9 despite offsetting industry moves. Leisure and hospitality rose to 4.0 and other services to 2.5, but health care and social assistance eased to 1.7 and construction fell to 1.3. That mix argues for no material level adjustment from the 1.9 persistence prior."
